        <mxCell id="c154" value="A failed file never stops the import: read errors, archive limits (1 GiB per entry, 4 GiB per archive), empty or binary files, no matching importer, no events and contained panics become an &lt;b&gt;UnrecognizedFile&lt;/b&gt; with its reason. Cancelled files are listed as &quot;Not imported&quot;. Plugin importers and hooks run inside Guarded* adapters (panics counted, quarantined after 3)." style="fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DIBM%2BPlex%2BSans%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C400%3B0%2C700%3B1%2C400%26display%3Dblock;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="2432" width="1120" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
